  "source": "package",
  "name": "Sequence Inverse Modified Asinh Stretch (seqinvmodasinh)",
  "description": "Same command as INVMODASINH but the sequence must be specified as the first argument. In addition, the optional argument -prefix= can be used to set a custom prefix\n\nLinks: invmodasinh\n\nUses fixed input references and writes only invocation-owned outputs. Optional argument values are sent only when their use_* control is true; zero is preserved.",
